    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenging Terrains and Obstacles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Narrow paths, steep slopes and deep mud-covered roads await you. Determine the right strategy and cooperate with your team to reach seemingly impossible points.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Vehicle Maintenance and Customization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't neglect the maintenance of your 4x4 vehicle to become the star of off-road! From tire selection to suspension upgrades, multiply your performance and dominate the terrain.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Camping and Recreation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After long and tiring drives, camp in the lap of nature. Gather around the fire, gather energy and set your course for the next challenging stage.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strategic Route Planning</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just stepping on the gas is not enough! Plan well to maintain a balance of speed, fuel and endurance on challenging courses. When your timing is right, no obstacle can stand in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solo or Team Up</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your solo driving skills to the test, or join forces with friends in four-player co-op mode. Team spirit makes the difference even on the most dangerous tracks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Start the engine, defy nature and push the limits of your off-road passion with Off Road Together!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenging Terrains and Obstacles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Narrow paths, steep slopes and deep mud-covered roads await you. Determine the right strategy and cooperate with your team to reach seemingly impossible points.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Vehicle Maintenance and Customization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't neglect the maintenance of your 4x4 vehicle to become the star of off-road! From tire selection to suspension upgrades, multiply your performance and dominate the terrain.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Camping and Recreation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After long and tiring drives, camp in the lap of nature. Gather around the fire, gather energy and set your course for the next challenging stage.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strategic Route Planning</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just stepping on the gas is not enough! Plan well to maintain a balance of speed, fuel and endurance on challenging courses. When your timing is right, no obstacle can stand in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solo or Team Up</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your solo driving skills to the test, or join forces with friends in four-player co-op mode. Team spirit makes the difference even on the most dangerous tracks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Start the engine, defy nature and push the limits of your off-road passion with Off Road Together!</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "Off Road Together: An adventurous off-road experience in single or co-op mode for up to 4 people! Drive 4x4 vehicles through challenging terrain, overcome obstacles and camp and rest. Upgrade your equipment, strategize with your team and reach the top!",
